' Group control. Hire two in New Sandez and take them to Nob Hill. Leave them standing
' and go to the spring alone: the leader waits for a group that is not coming, gives up,
' and drinks alone. Call them back, walk away and come to the spring again: this time
' the wait ends when they arrive, and the group drinks too.
mapclick 75,303          ' walk into New Sandez
clickon 248              ' walk up to a mercenary and hire him with the meat
hire
trade                    ' the canteen for a meat
trade
uiclick 204,211
uiclick 318,128
deal
esc                      ' the trader's scene stays after a deal (OnButtonAccept); leave it
clickon 63               ' and a second mercenary, paid with that meat
hire
esc                      ' out onto the world map, the group with you
mapclick 19,292          ' sets out; the days on the road pass by themselves (v0.9.1 skips a travelling player's turns)
mapclick 19,292          ' in, the group on the entry point with you
wait 60
group                    ' alone: the group stays where it stands
mapclick 277,105         ' to the spring room, alone: nobody comes, and the wait runs out
esc                      ' out of the room again
save                     ' the cut: saved in single mode, the group standing apart
group                    ' as a group: they follow again
mapclick 255,95          ' a step away from the door, on the far side from the group
mapclick 277,105         ' back to the door: wait there for the group to arrive, then in
esc
save
